packages/registry/attribution/

# Installability records are generated by `scripts/record-installability.sh` and their
# exact bytes are a contract: `installability.test.ts` re-serialises each one through
# the writer and requires byte-identity, so a record edited by hand fails verify offline.
# A formatter reflowing them would break that test while changing no fact — and would
# make the formatter, rather than the recorder, the thing that decides what a record is.
packages/registry/installability/
